        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this fabulous two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment to the market within the quiet and highly sought-after development of Shackleton House, Clonee, Dublin 15. Shackleton House is a well-established residential development ideally positioned close to a wealth of local amenities including shops, cafés, leisure facilities and recreational amenities. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is within easy reach, while commuters are exceptionally well catered for with easy access to the N3, M3 and M50 motorway networks, providing excellent links throughout Dublin and beyond.\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation extending to approximately c. 81 sq m briefly comprises an entrance hallway, a generous open plan living/dining area with a fully fitted kitchen, two well-proportioned double bedrooms including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a family bathroom. A standout feature of this fine property is the stunning private sunny balcony overlooking beautifully landscaped communal green areas, providing an ideal space to relax and unwind. The development also consists of secure underground parking.\nNo.28 comes to the market with a B BER rating qualifying of a green mortgage, gas fired central heating, double glazed windows and a private sunny balcony. This fantastic apartment is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike. Early viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures:\n• 2 Bed/ 2 Bath 2nd Floor apartment\n• Immaculate condition\n• B BER rating qualifying of a green mortgage\n• c. 81 sq m\n• Private sunny balcony\n• Secure underground parking.\n• Balcony overlooking landscaped green area\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Built in 2005\n• Quiet and well-established development\n• Popular and highly sought-after location\n• Close to shops and local amenities\n• Blanchardstown Shopping Centre within easy reach\n• Easy access to the N3, M3 & M50 motorway networks\n• NO-onward chain\n• Ideal for first-time buyers and downsizers\n• Early viewing strongly advised\n\nDirections:\nEircode = D15 NH24"
      },
      {
